# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gadgetzan

step Innkeeper Vizzie
  when zone "Winterspring"
  when turnedin 93197
  zone Winterspring
  tip Innkeeper Vizzie, in Everlook's inn, has more mail for you: the Ice Thistle Yetis in the hills south-east of town carry it. Keep it for the last guide, whose ride back north from Frostwhisper Gorge crosses those hills.
  accept 93406                        -- Innkeeper Vizzie: Unfrozen Deliveries

