step Noggle's Lost Satchel
  tip The satchel lies in the mountains of the far south, past Bronzebeard's Encampment. Deathclasp, an elite scorpid, patrols near it: grab it while he is away.
  collect 20379 quest 8282.1

step Deathclasp
  when onquest 8283
  when group 8283
  tip With your group: Deathclasp walks the mountains around the satchel. Pull him away from the other scorpids.
  collect 20385 quest 8283 @45.1,92.3 -- Deathclasp's Pincer

step Dearest Natalia
  tip Frankal Stonebridge and Rutgar Glyphshaper camp at Bronzebeard's Encampment, just north of the satchel's mountains. Question them: go through each one's whole conversation; there is no need to fight them.
  talk 15171 quest 8304.1 @40.8,88.9 map 1451
  talk 15170 quest 8304.2 @41.3,88.5 map 1451
  turnin 8308                         -- Rutgar Glyphshaper, if Brann's letter dropped for you

step Twilight Base Camp
  when onquest 8318
  tip Collect twenty Encrypted Twilight Texts, ten for Bor Wildmane and ten for Ortell. The Twilight Base Camp holds only elementals: the texts drop from the Twilight's Hammer cultists of the Vanguard in the far south-west, the Post in the west and the Outpost west of Cenarion Hold. Take them from the Twilight Avengers and Geolords; leave the Flamereavers and Stonecallers (59-60).
  collect 20404 quest 8318.1
  collect 20404 x20                   -- ten for each quest: Bor Wildmane takes his ten before Ortell

