step Lar'korwi
  tip Open Torwa's Pouch: it holds the meat and the pheromone mixture. Lar'korwi's lair is the bone-strewn valley just south of the pylon: place the meat among the bones, then use the mixture on it to call Lar'korwi. He is level 56 and hits hard, so start at full health.
  collect 11510 quest 4292

